        266.91,
        141.01,
        266.91
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the Members\nof the Council of Ministers shown in the attached list\nrelinquished charge of their respective portfolios, with\neffect from the afternoon of March 24, 1977."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
